658 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If there is an obstacle close in front \(lidar_front<900\), and space to the right \(lidar_right>1500\), and the right flag is set \(right_f.value\) but not the left flag, the robot triggers a right turn \(turn_trigger.value = True\).)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
659 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If there is an obstacle close in front, and space to the left \(lidar_left>1500\), and the left flag is set \(left_f.value\) but not the right flag, the robot triggers a left turn.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
660 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If neither condition is met, the robot does not trigger a turn \(turn_trigger.value = False\).)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [7]
>>
